M140 S85 ; set bed temp
M190 S85 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S230 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X185.353 Y24.5868 W24.8854 H20.0052 ; mesh bed levelling

